OL,3,AAbducted South African journalist found
OL,4,Adead with gunshot wounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes are pouring in for a veteran
OL,7,FSouth African sports broadcaster who
OL,8,Fwas found dead on Wednesday hours after
OL,9,Fbeing abducted when his vehicle was
OL,10,Fhijacked in a township near
OL,11,FJohannesburg.
OL,13,FOwen Ndlovu, a former presenter with
OL,14,Fthe country's public broadcaster, the
OL,15,FSABC, was seized on Tuesday while
OL,16,Fcollecting his wife from a church in
OL,17,FKatlehong, police said.
OL,19,FHis body, which witnesses said had
OL,20,Fgunshot wounds, was discovered by
OL,21,Fresidents the following morning.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
