OL,3,AAbducted South African journalist found
OL,4,Adead with gunshot wounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have launched a manhunt for
OL,7,Fthree suspects and are investigating
OL,8,Fthe circumstances surrounding his
OL,9,Fkilling, which has once again drawn
OL,10,Fattention to South Africa's high levels
OL,11,Fof violent crime.
